[{"sha":"8bfcfd9eb4136044d1e3ec54d61726e1d781ebc0","node_id":"C_kwDOO5D6p9oAKDhiZmNmZDllYjQxMzYwNDRkMWUzZWM1NGQ2MTcyNmUxZDc4MWViYzA","commit":{"author":{"name":"codex-cli","email":"guoqiyang25@gmail.com","date":"2026-07-07T18:28:57Z"},"committer":{"name":"codex-cli","email":"guoqiyang25@gmail.com","date":"2026-07-07T18:28:57Z"},"message":"feat(method-map): add post-attempt MS rights/display gate (#1432)\n\nDefine, enforce and report the post-attempt Mark Scheme rights/display\ngates as a narrow sibling of the #1429 schema and #1431 all-3530 read\nmodel. A pure resolveRightsDisplayGate() computes five independent\nstudent-display gates (payload / structured_feedback / official_ms_text\n/ official_ms_image / evidence_drawer) plus the source-asset\nreview/rights/quality/student/debug split, keeping answer-fact, source\ndisplay, structured display, scoring-claim and debug/review gates\nseparate.\n\nThe validator enforces the hard rules across eight cases (rights-approved\nsource, rights-review-required, rights-blocked, internal-only, candidate\nscreenshot hidden, quality-blocked hidden, structured native without\nsource image, structured derived feedback allowed while official\nimage/text stay blocked): candidate screenshots never student-facing;\nrights-unconfirmed/blocked/internal images hidden; structured derived\ndisplay never implies official image/text approval; official source\ndisplay never implies answer facts or scoring authority; no\nsource_image_only primary learner display. Upstream schema/read-model\nare anchored from checked-in artifacts only — no Supabase/RAG/vector or\nfrontend integration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"652131c4bd673d65e41c30690d37dfda39e5594e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/git/trees/652131c4bd673d65e41c30690d37dfda39e5594e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/git/commits/8bfcfd9eb4136044d1e3ec54d61726e1d781ebc0","comment_count":0,"ve